{"4820140": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "TAKE CARE OF THE DOG", "steam_appid": 4820140, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Woof woof! -Dog.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to play! TCOTD is a short story about... taking care of a dog! Play around, follow him, find items, and a lot more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Recomendations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a ‘late-night game’. Try playing it at night, with the lights off and a headset on, when everyone in your house is asleep. It's about atmosphere!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk - W A S D <br>Interact - Left Mouse Button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4820140/extras/10308c88c5d31af3b930f10013dd2307.avif?t=1783665623\" width=118 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">TAKE CARE OF THE DOG is a pretty short game I made while recovering from the surgery I had after I broke my arm <br>(I lost my movements, but I am slowly getting 'em back!!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>A new TAKE CARE OF is being developed based on your feedback! Thank you so much for the kind words.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Woof woof! -Dog.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's time to play! TCOTD is a short story about... taking care of a dog! Play around, follow him, find items, and a lot more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Recomendations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a ‘late-night game’. Try playing it at night, with the lights off and a headset on, when everyone in your house is asleep. It's about atmosphere!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk - W A S D <br>Interact - Left Mouse Button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4820140/extras/10308c88c5d31af3b930f10013dd2307.avif?t=1783665623\" width=118 height=126 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">TAKE CARE OF THE DOG is a pretty short game I made while recovering from the surgery I had after I broke my arm <br>(I lost my movements, but I am slowly getting 'em back!!)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br>A new TAKE CARE OF is being developed based on your feedback! Thank you so much for the kind words.</p>", "short_description": "Hello! Hi! How are you? It's time to play! TAKE CARE OF THE DOG is a short story about... taking care of a dog! Play around, follow him, find items, go get the water in the basement (for some reason) and a lot more!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "“I can't believe something so beautiful can exist in such a terrible world.”<br />\r\nCaseOh<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“Go, doggy, good boy, good doggy. Woah, this dog is fast.”<br />\r\nIShowSpeed<br />\r\n<br />\r\n“I am purging him from the face of the Earth, obliterating his existence.”<br />\r\nFelps<br />\r\n", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4820140/b9c80bc73dfb31ae57f3241a91de078463a76c3a/header.jpg?t=1783665623", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4820140/bc9661ad43bb9154231589bcd5bf0a0983e620e8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783665623", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4820140/bc9661ad43bb9154231589bcd5bf0a0983e620e8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783665623", "website": "https://bodinhe.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong